      "side": 1,
      "message": "There was one hook I looked at, which was HOOK_AC_CHANGE, and others like HOOK_POWER_SUPPLY_CHANGE and HOOK_USB_PD_* changes.\nI guess what I could do is hook off any of these, and then run a deferred call to this check (I found the the mode status takes time to be updated).\nThat would avoid the polling.",
